{"id":"637311","name":"开花馒头","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/637311/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小麦胚芽","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母","amount":"适量"},{"name":"水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉加水揉成面团。","img":"images/637311/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"面粉加小麦胚芽加酵母揉成面团。盖盖子发酵。","img":"images/637311/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"面团发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/637311/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"小麦胚芽面团也发酵好了。","img":"images/637311/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"白色面团分成等份。","img":"images/637311/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"擀成厚片","img":"images/637311/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"小麦胚芽也分成等分揉成团。","img":"images/637311/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把小麦胚芽面团包起来。","img":"images/637311/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"像包包子一样。","img":"images/637311/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"口收紧。","img":"images/637311/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒扣过去","img":"images/637311/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"用刀在上面画十字。","img":"images/637311/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入蒸锅盖盖子二次发酵20分钟（冬季就多放十分钟）开过蒸20分钟关火。","img":"images/637311/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/637311/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"一起吃馒头吧！","img":"images/637311/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}